Algorithm: MergeSortedLists(L1, L2)

1. Start
2. Create an empty list called MERGED.
3. Set P = L1 and Q = L2.
4. Repeat while P != NULL and Q != NULL:
      a. If P.data < Q.data:
            Add P.data to MERGED
            Move P to the next node
      b. Otherwise:
            Add Q.data to MERGED
            Move Q to the next node
5. If P != NULL:
      Add all remaining nodes of P to MERGED.
6. If Q != NULL:
      Add all remaining nodes of Q to MERGED.
7. Return MERGED.
8. Stop
